        "official_en_sha256": "94c12c37314dc9b2572d97cdd8950dd6d8d970dba0831d0c99c4d4731b2244e5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "は！　もちろんです。\r\nこの部隊に所属するのが目標でしたから。",
        "official_en": "I won’t let you down, sirs! Let me just say, I’ve wanted to be assigned to your division for the longest time.",
        "real_en": "Yes, sir! Joining this squadron has been my goal."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
