        "official_en_sha256": "ffe66018b909ae47028c86b4cefc4f90557eec7a80a00283d619a2a446aea46e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "わかってるって。\r\n身だしなみと言葉遣いと……早寝早起きだっけ？",
        "official_en": "I know, I know. I gotta look the part and act the part...and get up early, too, right?",
        "real_en": "I know, I know. Watch my appearance, watch how I speak...and early to bed, early to rise, right?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
