      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ナンバーワン？\r\nそれはラスウェルの方だろ。",
        "official_en": "Me, Grandshelt’s finest? You <text style=\"italic\">know</> that title belongs to you.",
        "real_en": "Number one? That’s you, Lasswell."
