        "official_en_sha256": "d1416cc1bfa49bc5d0735f2b9aec51ce798a43570d6645ed01c9ad9ae50e813d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラスウェルだって。\r\n俺が言うんだ。そうに決まってる。",
        "official_en": "Just as I’m sure that’s you. No doubt about it.",
        "real_en": "I’m telling you, it’s Lasswell. And if I say so, it must be true."
