        "official_en_sha256": "1baae13d1cc376b31691361bcde1dec751e047466b3220f70031f06c12b789bc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン隊長、お疲れ様です！\r\n王は執務中ですので、\r\nまた後ほどお越しください。",
        "official_en": "Sir! His Majesty is currently indisposed. Please return again later.",
        "real_en": "Commander Rain, thank you for your hard work! The king is attending to his duties, so please come back later."
