    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_004_01_B:004_01_B_027:e9947ded",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_004_01_B",
        "key": "004_01_B_027",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_004_01_B:004_01_B_027:e9947ded",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_004_01_B:004_01_B_027:e9947ded",
        "jp_sha256": "00b20a0d4327649ee5008fb37df84b877fb0afe96340302b7dadd3eeca8ee23e",
        "official_en_sha256": "74ede0c8e4f203e362c7711b886161a8c23997dc2c92a36926fc87daa484d709"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン隊長が築き上げた飛空艇部隊……\r\n空を駆けて現場に急行し、より多くの命を救い出す。\r\nその考えに深く共感しました。",
        "official_en": "I’m a huge fan of what you’ve done with your airship squadron, Commander Rain—the way you soar through the sky, rushing to get to the scene to save as many lives as possible.",
        "real_en": "The airship squadron you built, Commander Rain... Racing across the skies to reach those in need and save as many lives as possible. That’s a vision I wholeheartedly share."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
