        "official_en_sha256": "fb36fa5d010de521939ac1a381705b60f13e3f164f215a96263fedc6e9ef2c8b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "同期のなかでも実力が抜きん出ていた\r\nおまえならば、立派に務めを果たすだろう。\r\n私も早く追いつけるよう、精進せねば。",
        "official_en": "Seeing as you were top of the class back in the academy, you should have no problem doing a stellar job. I’ll be right behind you, though.",
        "real_en": "You stood out even among those who joined alongside you. I’m sure you’ll do your duty admirably. I must keep training to catch up with you."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
