      "text": {
        "jp": "土の神殿へ行ってくる。\r\n留守中の警備は任せたからな。",
        "official_en": "We’re heading to the Earth Shrine. We need you to hold the fort while we’re away.",
        "real_en": "We’re heading to the Earth Shrine. I’m leaving security here in your hands while we’re gone."
